1
00:00:00,560 --> 00:00:03,190
Everyone, advance before Tsubasa returns!

2
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:04,400
One more goal!

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:05,810
Oh no!

4
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:07,150
Guys, fall back!

5
00:00:07,820 --> 00:00:09,030
Roles have changed!

6
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:11,150
This time Shutetsu is counter-attacking!

7
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:12,900
As if I'd allow it!

8
00:00:13,570 --> 00:00:14,160
Taki!

9
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:16,160
Alright!

10
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,530
That's it, the second goal is coming.

11
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:18,950
What?!

12
00:00:19,450 --> 00:00:22,870
Tsubasa-kun takes the ball from Taki-kun!

13
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:26,210
He's going to shoot.

14
00:00:26,210 --> 00:00:27,460
Shoot!

15
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:28,090
What?

16
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:30,340
Could this be...

17
00:00:30,340 --> 00:00:34,880
Tsubasa-kun took a long shot from his own half!

18
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:38,720
Wakabayashi-kun catches it beautifully!

19
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:42,060
That was astonishing!

20
00:00:42,060 --> 00:00:44,100
Who would have thought he'd shoot from there?

21
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:46,020
But it wasn't a goal.

22
00:00:46,020 --> 00:00:48,110
Are you panicking, Tsubasa?

23
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:49,770
You're focusing too much on shooting.

24
00:00:49,770 --> 00:00:52,320
Football is played with 11 people.

25
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,570
You can't score alone.

26
