The endless blue sky stretched out above me

29
00:01:13,590 --> 00:01:18,260
The endless blue sky stretched out above me

30
00:01:19,510 --> 00:01:24,180
This winding and random road

31
00:01:19,510 --> 00:01:24,180
This winding and random road

32
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:32,770
Is a map for our endless dreams

33
00:01:25,060 --> 00:01:32,770
Is a map for our endless dreams

34
00:01:32,770 --> 00:01:38,530
Even if hope misses its target

35
00:01:32,770 --> 00:01:38,530
Even if hope misses its target

36
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:47,290
As long as I get back up, my dreams will never end

37
00:01:38,530 --> 00:01:47,290
As long as I get back up, my dreams will never end

38
00:01:47,290 --> 00:01:52,840
Number one! Get out in front, ahead of everyone

39
00:01:47,290 --> 00:01:52,840
Number one! Get out in front, ahead of everyone

40
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:58,760
Start running, with your tricky play, towards the world stage! Start! Dash!

41
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:58,760
Start running, with your tricky play, towards the world stage! Start! Dash!

42
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,430
Run & Run!

43
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,430
Run & Run!

44
00:02:00,430 --> 00:02:07,640
Only our aspirations are the signals that move us, bit by bit

45
00:02:00,430 --> 00:02:07,640
Only our aspirations are the signals that move us, bit by bit

46
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:10,650
Blaze, blaze, blaze and launch the kick

47
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:10,650
Blaze, blaze, blaze and launch the kick

48
00:02:10,650 --> 00:02:15,070
Jump out onto the huge TV screen

49
00:02:10,650 --> 00:02:15,070
Jump out onto the huge TV screen

50
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:30,250
Episode 8:
The Birth of Nankatsu's Golden Duo

51
00:02:26,040 --> 00:02:30,250
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

52
00:02:27,250 --> 00:02:28,500
He intercepts!

53
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:31,630
Tsubasa-kun steals the ball again!

54
00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:34,000
He's the only important one at Nankatsu!

55
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,210
Don't mark anyone else besides Tsubasa!

56
00:02:40,430 --> 00:02:41,260
What?

57
00:02:41,890 --> 00:02:43,510
Nice pass.

58
00:02:43,510 --> 00:02:48,520
Wow! Tsubasa-kun draws the defense and makes a wonderful pass!

59
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:50,520
Everyone, here's the chance!

60
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,610
Remember the special practice we did with Roberto!

61
00:02:52,610 --> 00:02:53,610
Okay!

62
00:02:53,610 --> 00:02:55,110
Calm down.

63
00:02:55,110 --> 00:02:56,610
Take a good look around.

64
00:02:56,610 --> 00:02:58,530
Send it inside.

65
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:00,280
Let's go!

66
00:03:00,280 --> 00:03:00,950
Hey!

67
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:02,700
Hey!

68
00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:04,030
Once more.

69
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:05,790
Th-These guys...

70
00:03:05,790 --> 00:03:07,330
Even though they're Nankatsu...

71
00:03:08,330 --> 00:03:10,370
Nankatsu is passing like this for the first time.

72
00:03:10,370 --> 00:03:14,000
Shutetsu, drawn by Tsubasa-kun, can't catch up!

73
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,710
Tsubasa...

74
00:03:15,710 --> 00:03:18,630
Was he trying to draw all the attention with that shot?

75
00:03:18,630 --> 00:03:20,010
If so...

76
00:03:20,010 --> 00:03:21,880
...he has an amazing game sense!

77
00:03:21,880 --> 00:03:22,720
Here.

78
00:03:22,720 --> 00:03:23,840
Alright!

79
00:03:23,840 --> 00:03:26,560
Tsubasa-kun's long pass was about to go out!

80
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,470
Stop it!

81
00:03:27,470 --> 00:03:28,270
Damn it!

82
00:03:28,270 --> 00:03:31,020
Nankatsu has caught an amazing rhythm!

83
00:03:31,020 --> 00:03:32,440
Go for it!

84
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:33,730
Ishizaki-kun sends a cross!

85
00:03:33,730 --> 00:03:36,400
A beautiful cross!

86
00:03:39,530 --> 00:03:42,070
Wakabayashi-kun loses his balance because of the decoy!

87
00:03:42,070 --> 00:03:44,530
There's Tsubasa-kun rushing towards the ball!

88
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:47,160
He jumps and heads it!

89
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:50,290
Will it be the equalizing goal for Nankatsu?

90
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,670
The ball bounces strangely.

91
00:03:53,670 --> 00:03:56,290
Nankatsu couldn't score the tying goal!

92
00:03:56,290 --> 00:03:59,050
Tsubasa! That was really close!

93
00:03:59,050 --> 00:04:01,630
That's it! Keep it up!

94
00:04:01,630 --> 00:04:02,970
What a shame.

95
00:04:02,970 --> 00:04:04,970
It was so close.

96
00:04:04,970 --> 00:04:06,970
Guys, we're doing great.

97
00:04:06,970 --> 00:04:08,760
Let's keep going like this.

98
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:10,220
Okay!

99
00:04:14,100 --> 00:04:16,060
Luck is a part of talent.

100
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:20,610
Tsubasa, I'm sorry, but we will be the ones winning this match.

101
00:04:20,610 --> 00:04:21,490
Alright!

102
00:04:21,490 --> 00:04:22,610
Time for the birdcage!

103
00:04:22,610 --> 00:04:24,450
What? Birdcage?

104
00:04:24,450 --> 00:04:26,620
Are we really going to do that?

105
00:04:26,990 --> 00:04:28,330
He said birdcage?

106
00:04:29,620 --> 00:04:30,910
Birdcage?

107
00:04:34,250 --> 00:04:37,000
Time flows like water.

108
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:42,340
Who would have expected things to develop like this before the match?

109
00:04:42,340 --> 00:04:44,180
How many times has it been?

110
00:04:44,180 --> 00:04:46,470
Tsubasa-kun goes to steal the ball again!

111
00:04:46,470 --> 00:04:47,430
He's coming!

112
00:04:47,430 --> 00:04:49,010
Don't take your eyes off him.

113
00:04:49,010 --> 00:04:50,470
Pass quickly.

114
00:04:50,470 --> 00:04:51,720
Okay.

115
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,390
Alright. Here.

116
00:04:55,060 --> 00:04:55,900
No use.

117
00:04:55,900 --> 00:04:57,440
I can't steal the ball like this.

118
00:04:59,940 --> 00:05:01,900
I'm coming, cross...

119
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:05,360
...I would have said!

120
00:05:05,910 --> 00:05:09,120
Shutetsu keeps the ball away by passing.

121
00:05:09,120 --> 00:05:12,620
They have no intention of attacking at all.

122
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:14,790
Birdcage...

123
00:05:14,790 --> 00:05:18,630
I wouldn't expect an elementary school team to use such a tactic.

124
00:05:19,210 --> 00:05:21,300
You start by keeping the ball in your own half.

125
00:05:21,300 --> 00:05:24,050
As you draw the opponent, you send the ball to the center...

126
00:05:24,050 --> 00:05:26,050
...and prevent them from moving.

127
00:05:26,050 --> 00:05:29,800
A tactic used by professionals to buy time.

128
00:05:31,470 --> 00:05:35,350
That way, you can't do anything until the game ends.

129
00:05:35,890 --> 00:05:39,480
Yes, just like birds trapped in a cage.

130
00:05:41,150 --> 00:05:42,980
You're being cowards, Shutetsu!

131
00:05:42,980 --> 00:05:46,650
Don't you know how to fight more fairly?!

132
00:05:47,070 --> 00:05:47,860
They did it again!

133
00:05:47,860 --> 00:05:49,450
They're passing the ball around again.

134
00:05:49,450 --> 00:05:54,870
Shutetsu may be the reigning national tournament champion, but...

135
00:05:54,870 --> 00:05:57,250
...is it possible for them to display such a game?

136
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,540
Say what you want.

137
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:01,540
The biggest reason we are the victors...

138
00:06:01,540 --> 00:06:03,250
...is that we can't stand losing.

139
00:06:03,250 --> 00:06:05,260
Especially to you, Ozora Tsubasa.

140
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,300
Wakabayashi-kun...

141
00:06:09,140 --> 00:06:11,510
Tsubasa! I'll get the ball back!

142
00:06:12,100 --> 00:06:13,760
And once I do, I'll pass to you...

143
00:06:13,760 --> 00:06:15,390
...so go in front of the goal!

144
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:16,730
We have no other choice!

145
00:06:16,730 --> 00:06:17,520
Okay!

146
00:06:17,520 --> 00:06:19,520
We're up against Ishizaki?

147
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:21,520
Couldn't be better.

148
00:06:22,770 --> 00:06:24,280
I will definitely get it back!

149
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,740
Ishizaki-kun can't get the ball back!

150
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:35,870
The score is 1-0 and there's very little time left!

151
00:06:35,870 --> 00:06:38,000
But if they all go together...

152
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,540
...the defense will weaken and...

153
00:06:39,540 --> 00:06:42,210
...Shutetsu could score another goal.

154
00:06:42,210 --> 00:06:45,340
Ishizaki! Aren't you the captain?

155
00:06:45,340 --> 00:06:47,210
Hang in there a bit more!

156
00:06:47,210 --> 00:06:49,840
Yes! Hold on, Nankatsu!

157
00:06:49,840 --> 00:06:52,890
You've come this far against Shutetsu!

158
00:06:52,890 --> 00:06:54,600
Try a little harder!

159
00:06:55,850 --> 00:06:58,140
What do you mean "you've come this far"?

160
00:06:58,140 --> 00:07:02,190
We didn't come this far because of us. It was because of him.

161
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:07,110
The reason we've come this far is Tsubasa, who joined our lousy soccer team.

162
00:07:07,610 --> 00:07:09,650
Beating Nishigaoka...

163
00:07:09,650 --> 00:07:13,660
...practicing hard believing we could beat Shutetsu...

164
00:07:14,450 --> 00:07:17,950
...and coming this far in this match having conceded only one goal...

165
00:07:17,950 --> 00:07:20,960
...isn't it all thanks to Tsubasa?

166
00:07:21,710 --> 00:07:22,920
At the very least...

167
00:07:22,920 --> 00:07:26,630
At the very least, I have to get the ball and pass it to Tsubasa.

168
00:07:26,630 --> 00:07:30,260
Otherwise, we will have accomplished nothing!

169
00:07:30,260 --> 00:07:33,090
The referee is looking at his watch!

170
00:07:33,090 --> 00:07:35,550
Time is about to run out!

171
00:07:35,550 --> 00:07:37,680
Damn it, we can't go on like this!

172
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,520
Now or never!

173
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:40,230
I'm going to help our captain.

174
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:42,400
Me too!

175
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:43,900
M-Me too!

176
00:07:45,230 --> 00:07:46,320
What?

177
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:48,190
Hey, let's switch sides.

178
00:07:48,190 --> 00:07:49,360
A-Alright.

179
00:07:50,190 --> 00:07:51,650
They're going to switch sides?

180
00:07:51,650 --> 00:07:52,740
If so...

181
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:53,990
I'm leaving it to you, Taki!

182
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:57,790
Ishizaki-kun predicted where the ball would go for the first time!

183
00:07:57,790 --> 00:07:58,790
Oh no!

184
00:08:03,830 --> 00:08:04,670
My foot!

185
00:08:04,670 --> 00:08:07,460
There was a hard collision and the ball...

186
00:08:07,460 --> 00:08:10,010
If I don't get the ball now, there won't be another chance!

187
00:08:11,670 --> 00:08:13,680
Tsubasa!

188
00:08:16,390 --> 00:08:19,100
The pass reaches Tsubasa!

189
00:08:19,100 --> 00:08:20,390
Ishizaki-kun!

190
00:08:27,610 --> 00:08:32,450
Finally... Finally, Nankatsu breaks the birdcage!

191
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:40,750
That's the best I could do.

192
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:41,870
I'm counting on you!

193
00:08:42,330 --> 00:08:45,000
Ishizaki-kun put his body on the line to make this pass.

194
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,790
I won't let it go to waste.

195
00:08:47,210 --> 00:08:48,290
I'm coming!

196
00:08:48,290 --> 00:08:49,500
You're coming?

197
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:52,760
Then let's settle this!

198
00:08:52,760 --> 00:08:53,590
The winners...

199
00:08:54,300 --> 00:08:56,340
...will be us, Shutetsu!

200
00:08:56,340 --> 00:08:57,510
Do it!

201
00:08:57,510 --> 00:08:59,100
If you don't score now...

202
00:08:59,100 --> 00:09:00,770
...I'll disown you!

203
00:09:00,770 --> 00:09:02,850
I'll disown you!

204
00:09:03,770 --> 00:09:06,480
Injury time is advancing.

205
00:09:06,480 --> 00:09:09,360
This may be Nankatsu's last chance.

206
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:12,070
Really?

207
00:09:12,070 --> 00:09:14,650
Tsubasa-kun fixes his eyes on the goal and advances alone.

208
00:09:15,070 --> 00:09:15,910
Alright!

209
00:09:15,910 --> 00:09:17,070
I've more or less arrived!

210
00:09:17,070 --> 00:09:18,620
Don't be so hasty!

211
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:21,040
We're still here.

212
00:09:21,040 --> 00:09:23,160
We won't let you beat us alone!

213
00:09:23,160 --> 00:09:25,160
We'll crush you!

214
00:09:25,160 --> 00:09:26,170
Take that!

215
00:09:27,420 --> 00:09:31,130
Tsubasa-kun jumps over Kisugi's slide tackle.

216
00:09:31,130 --> 00:09:34,720
However, there's the giant Takasugi-kun.

217
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,970
- Tsubasa!
- Be careful!

218
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:41,390
No one can catch him!

219
00:09:42,010 --> 00:09:44,020
Now he's one-on-one with the goalkeeper.

220
00:09:44,020 --> 00:09:45,140
No, not yet!

221
00:09:45,140 --> 00:09:47,900
There's one more person. Midfielder Izawa-kun!

222
00:09:48,310 --> 00:09:49,400
I won't let you pass!

223
00:09:49,400 --> 00:09:50,900
Which way will he go?

224
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:53,610
What?!

225
00:09:53,610 --> 00:09:57,030
H-He finally managed to get past everyone!

226
00:09:57,030 --> 00:09:58,660
Ozora Tsubasa...

227
00:09:58,660 --> 00:10:00,160
What a kid.

228
00:10:00,160 --> 00:10:03,120
No matter what we do, we can't stop him!

229
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:04,330
Tsubasa...

230
00:10:04,330 --> 00:10:06,540
Come even closer.

231
00:10:07,210 --> 00:10:09,830
Tsubasa-kun is preparing to shoot.

232
00:10:09,830 --> 00:10:12,800
Why aren't you shooting from inside the penalty area, Tsubasa?

233
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:14,050
This is...

234
00:10:14,050 --> 00:10:15,800
He plans to shoot from outside the penalty area.

235
00:10:16,760 --> 00:10:19,930
Tsubasa-kun's long shot carries the fate of his team!

236
00:10:19,930 --> 00:10:21,430
The same spot again?

237
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:23,760
It won't work!

238
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:27,440
I will definitely stop a shot taken from outside the penalty area!

239
00:10:27,810 --> 00:10:29,900
Wakabayashi-kun responds wonderfully!

240
00:10:29,900 --> 00:10:31,940
But the ball is still in play!

241
00:10:31,940 --> 00:10:33,340
- Go in!
- Stay out!

242
00:10:33,980 --> 00:10:36,070
The ball hits the post!

243
00:10:36,360 --> 00:10:37,320
I did it!

244
00:10:37,320 --> 00:10:39,820
Nankatsu can't equalize!

245
00:10:41,700 --> 00:10:44,080
T-Tsubasa...

246
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,330
He's flying!

247
00:10:45,330 --> 00:10:47,330
Th-This is...

248
00:10:52,080 --> 00:10:54,340
Overhead kick!

249
00:11:01,010 --> 00:11:04,350
Th-The equalizer!

250
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:07,310
I did it.

251
00:11:07,310 --> 00:11:10,060
I did it!

252
00:11:11,310 --> 00:11:12,310
That's it!

253
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,320
Tsubasa-kun...

254
00:11:17,820 --> 00:11:20,240
N-No way...

255
00:11:23,910 --> 00:11:24,830
There.

256
00:11:24,830 --> 00:11:27,500
The whistle signaling the end of the match.

257
00:11:27,500 --> 00:11:29,830
No team emerged victorious in 40 minutes.

258
00:11:30,250 --> 00:11:33,330
After a 5-minute break...

259
00:11:33,330 --> 00:11:36,590
...two 5-minute extra time periods will be played.

260
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:41,220
Everyone, you did a good job.

261
00:11:41,220 --> 00:11:43,050
Still, Tsubasa...

262
00:11:43,050 --> 00:11:44,470
...I'm amazed!

263
00:11:44,470 --> 00:11:46,470
The move I showed in our first encounter...

264
00:11:46,890 --> 00:11:48,560
...the overhead kick on a ball rebounding from the post...

265
00:11:49,230 --> 00:11:50,430
...even if it's a coincidence...

266
00:11:50,430 --> 00:11:52,810
...I didn't expect you to use it in a real match.

267
00:11:53,350 --> 00:11:58,690
But I practiced it a lot, so I was able to jump as soon as the ball hit the post.

268
00:11:58,690 --> 00:12:01,200
You're so cool, Tsubasa.

269
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,990
Extra time, huh...

270
00:12:02,990 --> 00:12:04,620
The situation is bad.

271
00:12:04,620 --> 00:12:06,240
By the way, Ishizaki-kun...

272
00:12:06,830 --> 00:12:08,740
Is your foot okay?

273
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:09,660
What are you saying?

274
00:12:09,660 --> 00:12:11,120
It's nothing serious.

275
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:13,040
Look how fine I am.

276
00:12:13,040 --> 00:12:15,040
Look, I can even do--

277
00:12:19,090 --> 00:12:20,420
Ishizaki-kun!

278
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:25,720
Ishizaki-kun, you can't play like this.

279
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:26,470
Idiot!

280
00:12:26,470 --> 00:12:28,010
An injury like this--

281
00:12:28,810 --> 00:12:29,890
Impossible.

282
00:12:32,980 --> 00:12:34,440
Who the hell are you?!

283
00:12:35,900 --> 00:12:37,730
I'm Misaki Taro.

284
00:12:41,190 --> 00:12:43,610
C-Captain...

285
00:12:49,910 --> 00:12:51,290
It's over.

286
00:12:52,540 --> 00:12:55,100
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

287
00:12:55,130 --> 00:13:00,090
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

288
00:13:05,090 --> 00:13:06,970
As I thought, it's sprained.

289
00:13:06,970 --> 00:13:09,310
The swelling won't go down for at least 3 days.

290
00:13:09,310 --> 00:13:12,270
How do you know that?!

291
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:16,850
Because my father travels a lot for work, so I read on the train.

292
00:13:16,850 --> 00:13:21,400
A book I read recently talked about first aid techniques in football.

293
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:22,650
Football?

294
00:13:22,650 --> 00:13:23,570
Yes.

295
00:13:23,570 --> 00:13:28,780
But what are we going to do now? We only have 11 players.

296
00:13:28,780 --> 00:13:31,450
What?! Ishizaki is injured?!

297
00:13:31,450 --> 00:13:34,040
Yes. Is there anyone who can replace him?

298
00:13:34,040 --> 00:13:36,710
Is there anyone who can play football?

299
00:13:36,710 --> 00:13:38,210
Football?

300
00:13:38,210 --> 00:13:39,460
Absolutely not.

301
00:13:39,460 --> 00:13:41,210
Impossible.

302
00:13:41,210 --> 00:13:43,630
Then I'll...

303
00:13:43,630 --> 00:13:44,720
Anego?!

304
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:48,890
Because then I'd get to play with Tsubasa-kun.

305
00:13:48,890 --> 00:13:49,850
What?!

306
00:13:49,850 --> 00:13:54,060
Then I, Urabe Hanji-sama, will go!

307
00:13:54,060 --> 00:13:57,730
No. I'll go. I'm more useful than you.

308
00:13:57,730 --> 00:14:00,650
Hold on. This is a match between Nankatsu and Shutetsu.

309
00:14:00,650 --> 00:14:02,150
People from other schools--

310
00:14:02,150 --> 00:14:03,030
I'll go.

311
00:14:03,030 --> 00:14:04,030
Me!

312
00:14:06,820 --> 00:14:08,780
Captain! Where are you going?

313
00:14:08,780 --> 00:14:10,160
I've said it.

314
00:14:10,170 --> 00:14:15,790
This match was a battle to show whether Tsubasa could score a goal against me or not.

315
00:14:16,460 --> 00:14:19,920
And I lost that battle.

316
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:23,340
Therefore, only you can play in extra time.

317
00:14:23,340 --> 00:14:24,800
Captain!

318
00:14:24,800 --> 00:14:26,550
Wait, Wakabayashi.

319
00:14:37,770 --> 00:14:39,060
Mikami-san.

320
00:14:39,060 --> 00:14:40,770
Don't be spoiled, Genzo!

321
00:14:40,770 --> 00:14:44,070
Are you running away because you conceded one goal?

322
00:14:44,070 --> 00:14:46,030
You should be ashamed of yourself.

323
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:50,110
I didn't coach you like this!

324
00:14:50,110 --> 00:14:54,040
From now on, I'm stopping coaching you, Genzo.

325
00:14:56,790 --> 00:15:01,710
Wakabayashi. I was the one who made you captain.

326
00:15:01,710 --> 00:15:05,960
But it was them who trusted you and supported you up to now.

327
00:15:06,710 --> 00:15:10,720
Are you going to turn your back on them now?

328
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:18,310
Showdown time! The winner plays in the match!

329
00:15:18,310 --> 00:15:19,810
No hard feelings.

330
00:15:19,810 --> 00:15:22,730
Come with everything you've got, but don't cry later!

331
00:15:24,230 --> 00:15:25,860
Oh, those two...

332
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:28,690
Look, could I join?

333
00:15:28,690 --> 00:15:32,620
What? Don't be stupid. You're not from Nankatsu either.

334
00:15:32,620 --> 00:15:34,660
I am from Nankatsu.

335
00:15:35,490 --> 00:15:37,450
I transferred today.

336
00:15:42,790 --> 00:15:43,960
You...

337
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:47,000
I'll sub in for the injured player. Misaki Taro.

338
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:48,210
Don't be ridiculous!

339
00:15:48,210 --> 00:15:49,300
The one who will play...

340
00:15:49,300 --> 00:15:50,630
...is us!

341
00:15:56,180 --> 00:15:57,310
Talented.

342
00:15:57,310 --> 00:15:59,140
Th-This...

343
00:16:03,690 --> 00:16:06,270
It's a bit big, but make do.

344
00:16:06,270 --> 00:16:09,190
Alright. Let's get along, Tsubasa-kun.

345
00:16:09,610 --> 00:16:12,200
Yes. Let's get along, Misaki-kun.

346
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:23,540
I lost the duel to Tsubasa.

347
00:16:25,330 --> 00:16:30,420
But first and foremost, I am the captain of Shutetsu.

348
00:16:33,050 --> 00:16:35,850
We will definitely win this match!

349
00:16:35,850 --> 00:16:37,810
Captain!

350
00:16:38,350 --> 00:16:39,930
Yes.

351
00:16:40,980 --> 00:16:43,940
It's time for extra time to begin.

352
00:16:43,940 --> 00:16:48,150
Alright, let's go! From this moment on, Shutetsu's true football begins!

353
00:16:48,150 --> 00:16:49,190
Yes!

354
00:16:49,190 --> 00:16:52,900
Okay, 10 more minutes! Give it everything you've got!

355
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:54,200
Yes!

356
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:57,120
My place is in your hands, guys!

357
00:17:00,490 --> 00:17:03,120
I'd expect nothing less from you, Genzo.

358
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:08,250
The first half of extra time begins. Nankatsu will kick off.

359
00:17:08,250 --> 00:17:12,380
What? Another unfamiliar person has come.

360
00:17:12,380 --> 00:17:13,510
Yes.

361
00:17:14,510 --> 00:17:18,010
Can you hear it? There's so much cheering.

362
00:17:18,010 --> 00:17:19,720
Let's win together today.

363
00:17:21,560 --> 00:17:24,310
I wonder what the next town will be like.

364
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:29,650
I understand. Tsubasa-kun and I are the same.

365
00:17:29,650 --> 00:17:32,610
Tsubasa-kun, I have a request.

366
00:17:33,690 --> 00:17:35,200
As soon as the whistle blows...

367
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:37,700
...quickly pass me the ball and run.

368
00:17:37,700 --> 00:17:39,950
Advance wherever you want.

369
00:17:39,950 --> 00:17:41,330
Alright.

370
00:17:44,460 --> 00:17:45,790
I'll get the ball!

371
00:17:51,460 --> 00:17:53,460
Who's this?

372
00:17:58,890 --> 00:17:59,970
Whose...

373
00:17:59,970 --> 00:18:00,970
...is he?

374
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:07,140
Unbelievable! It's served right to my foot!

375
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:12,320
A through ball! He sent a very delicate pass with a good thought.

376
00:18:12,320 --> 00:18:13,820
You...

377
00:18:20,030 --> 00:18:21,830
You're amazing, Misaki-kun.

378
00:18:21,830 --> 00:18:25,790
You can tell what I'm thinking from my eyes.

379
00:18:25,790 --> 00:18:28,540
You're the same, Tsubasa-kun.

380
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:34,550
Number 11 Misaki Taro-kun transferred to Nankatsu just today.

381
00:18:34,550 --> 00:18:36,920
They still had someone like that.

382
00:18:36,920 --> 00:18:38,720
What's wrong? It's okay.

383
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:39,550
What?

384
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:43,810
Genzo right now won't concede.

385
00:18:43,810 --> 00:18:47,060
Genzo, who until now only paid attention to Tsubasa...

386
00:18:47,060 --> 00:18:51,560
...now as captain aims to win together with his entire team.

387
00:18:51,980 --> 00:18:56,240
Genzo, currently watching the movements of everyone on the field...

388
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:59,820
...knows their positions as if they were in the palm of his hand.

389
00:18:59,820 --> 00:19:01,660
Since his attention is no longer divided...

390
00:19:01,660 --> 00:19:04,290
...he can react to every shot.

391
00:19:10,120 --> 00:19:13,590
Misaki Taro, you're quite talented too.

392
00:19:14,090 --> 00:19:18,510
This match has greatly improved you, Genzo.

393
00:19:18,510 --> 00:19:20,760
You're truly special.

394
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:22,760
We did it, Coach!

395
00:19:22,760 --> 00:19:25,010
We're dominating in extra time.

396
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:26,890
Tsubasa and Misaki.

397
00:19:26,890 --> 00:19:30,770
With this duo, Nankatsu will never lose.

398
00:19:30,770 --> 00:19:33,150
If I had known this would happen...

399
00:19:33,150 --> 00:19:35,900
...I would have injured you earlier.

400
00:19:37,190 --> 00:19:39,530
You're being ruthless, Coach.

401
00:19:40,570 --> 00:19:45,450
The whistle ending the first half of extra time!

402
00:19:46,910 --> 00:19:49,250
Genzo, you're leading well.

403
00:19:49,250 --> 00:19:50,870
Mikami-san!

404
00:19:50,870 --> 00:19:52,500
Everyone, do your best.

405
00:19:52,500 --> 00:19:54,340
Just a little bit more.

406
00:19:54,340 --> 00:19:57,550
They're struggling just the same. Last 5 minutes.

407
00:19:57,550 --> 00:20:00,050
Give it all your strength.

408
00:20:00,050 --> 00:20:01,260
Okay!

409
00:20:01,260 --> 00:20:04,510
There's no turning back, we have the last 5 minutes.

410
00:20:04,890 --> 00:20:08,140
Everyone, give it everything you've got and put on a fight you won't regret!

411
00:20:08,140 --> 00:20:09,180
Okay!

412
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:11,940
Exactly. The last 5 minutes.

413
00:20:11,940 --> 00:20:14,190
We'll fight with everything we have!

414
00:20:16,650 --> 00:20:20,240
The second half is only 5 minutes!

415
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:24,120
The second half begins with Shutetsu's kick-off.

416
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:25,780
Run Taki! Surprise attack!

417
00:20:26,490 --> 00:20:28,540
Shutetsu quickly moves to attack!

418
00:20:28,540 --> 00:20:32,040
Playmaker Izawa-kun sends a lightning long pass!

419
00:20:33,170 --> 00:20:34,040
What?

420
00:20:34,580 --> 00:20:38,050
Winger Taki-kun dribbles with his characteristic style!

421
00:20:38,050 --> 00:20:41,920
What? He passed it back to midfielder Izawa-kun.

422
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:43,510
Is he going to shoot?

423
00:20:44,140 --> 00:20:46,260
No, he lobbed it over the defense.

424
00:20:46,260 --> 00:20:50,270
Kisugi-kun moves to get the ball and fires a volley!

425
00:20:51,350 --> 00:20:54,400
The bouncing ball goes out for a corner!

426
00:20:57,110 --> 00:20:59,360
The first corner kick in extra time.

427
00:20:59,360 --> 00:21:01,030
An opportunity for Shutetsu.

428
00:21:01,030 --> 00:21:02,780
Guys, be careful!

429
00:21:02,780 --> 00:21:05,870
You must be careful against Shutetsu's set piece!

430
00:21:10,910 --> 00:21:12,040
Captain!

431
00:21:12,040 --> 00:21:13,410
Send it, Taki!

432
00:21:13,410 --> 00:21:17,950
What?! Goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun has come up to join the attack!

433
00:21:18,920 --> 00:21:22,090
The cross comes to Wakabayashi-kun!

434
00:21:24,630 --> 00:21:25,590
He shot!

435
00:21:25,590 --> 00:21:29,390
A shot stronger than any other player!

436
00:21:31,140 --> 00:21:34,100
Wakabayashi-kun, nice shot!

437
00:21:34,770 --> 00:21:36,100
That's it!

438
00:21:36,100 --> 00:21:39,110
2-1! Shutetsu has taken the lead!

439
00:21:39,110 --> 00:21:43,610
The winner of the match has been determined with this goal!

440
00:21:43,610 --> 00:21:47,070
Captain. If we execute the birdcage with the remaining time...

441
00:21:47,070 --> 00:21:49,490
Do you love the birdcage that much?

442
00:21:50,370 --> 00:21:54,710
Enough. It's a strategy for running away.

443
00:21:54,710 --> 00:21:56,120
Instead of protecting this goal...

444
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:59,630
...shall we not score one more and ensure victory?

445
00:21:59,630 --> 00:22:01,000
Captain!

446
00:22:01,000 --> 00:22:05,340
Unbelievable. Wakabayashi-kun is truly incredible.

447
00:22:05,340 --> 00:22:09,430
But the match isn't over yet. Now it's our turn.

448
00:22:09,430 --> 00:22:10,510
Yes!

449
00:22:11,180 --> 00:22:15,060
I won't let them say they lost because I joined.

450
